OL,3,GNEWSABirmingham 'glad Andy Taylor      
OL,4,Aanswered Duran Duran ad'               
OL,6,FIn 1980, guitarist Andy Taylor boarded 
OL,7,Fa train in Tyneside to attend an       
OL,8,Faudition in Birmingham.                
OL,10,FA band called Duran Duran had placed an
OL,11,Fadvert in Melody Maker seeking a       
OL,12,F"live-wire guitarist" and he was on his
OL,13,Fway to answer the call.                
OL,15,FThe musician, who died on Monday after 
OL,16,Fa battle with prostate cancer, would   
OL,17,Flater describe it as the "fateful      
OL,18,Fjourney down to Birmingham" that set   
OL,19,Fhim and his bandmates on a path to     
OL,20,Fglobal stardom.                        
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
