OL,3,GNEWSABirmingham 'glad Andy Taylor      
OL,4,Aanswered Duran Duran ad'               
OL,6,F"We're so glad that Andy answered that 
OL,7,Fadvert and did come down to Birmingham 
OL,8,Fand join Duran Duran," said Birmingham 
OL,9,FMusic Archive founder Jez Collins.     
OL,10,F"Because Birmingham music would sound  
OL,11,Fdifferent if he hadn't."               
